{"title": "[閒聊] 咳嗽都是如何用最快速度好起來？", "author": "Gwaygo (維尼GO)", "board": "", "date": "Sun Nov 22 23:10:02 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/WomenTalk/M.1795360204.A.CD7.html", "body": "咳嗽咳了差不多一週了\n目前還沒有好轉的跡象\n狂喝熱水、喝維他命發泡錠、多睡一點\n只會短暫感到舒適\n\n每次感冒都覺得咳嗽是最難治的\n大家都是如何治咳嗽的？", "comments": [{"tag": "推", "user": "benny3579", "content": "化痰", "time": "211.72.92.101 11/23 06:13"}, {"tag": "噓", "user": "anglesong", "content": "進入 asthma", "time": "123.194.155.3 11/23 06:39"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "Sabo5566", "content": "和正妹舌吻", "time": "76.35.169.131 11/23 07:21"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "shipping5566", "content": "就去診所找醫生拿藥  咳嗽真的不要", "time": "211.75.208.234 11/23 07:54"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "shipping5566", "content": "等  血淚屎跟你分享", "time": "211.75.208.234 11/23 07:54"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "sense10936", "content": "咳嗽本來就是最難好的 只能抗生素", "time": "118.231.150.114 11/23 07:54"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "sense10936", "content": "治療", "time": "118.231.150.114 11/23 07:54"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "Xa73", "content": "個頭咧 抗生素不是這樣用的", "time": "108.230.154.41 11/23 08:01"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "NEWOLD", "content": "看醫生", "time": "61.228.80.106 11/23 09:49"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "TOEY", "content": "ipad溫開水，15分鐘咳嗽out", "time": "49.218.91.163 11/23 10:06"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "lamourmoi", "content": "多吃大蒜 自己的偏方", "time": "118.166.13.196 11/23 11:33"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "MarkChe", "content": "蜂膠直接灌進喉嚨（消炎！）", "time": "211.20.197.92 11/23 12:03"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "tingtingya", "content": "才一週......", "time": "42.79.93.183 11/23 13:02"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "cashko", "content": "粉狀的龍角散我覺得有點幫助", "time": "36.224.244.220 11/23 14:32"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "funstory", "content": "就一直喝水一直睡", "time": "49.218.136.38 11/23 14:46"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "Nonesant", "content": "變嚴重前就要趕快去看醫生", "time": "42.74.251.2 11/23 16:13"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "ttitwei", "content": "感冒末期咳嗽看中醫吃中藥，很快好", "time": "223.138.249.137 11/23 16:21"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "ttitwei", "content": "。", "time": "223.138.249.137 11/23 16:21"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "ichbinotter", "content": "胸腔科", "time": "220.134.113.236 11/23 18:21"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "whoismama", "content": "欸？好像很久沒咳嗽了", "time": "101.10.79.42 11/23 18:40"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "SweetLee", "content": "睡覺", "time": "59.127.156.17 11/23 19:35"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "vennice", "content": "看醫生拿藥，有效縮短病程，喉嚨消C", "time": "126.91.138.242 11/23 20:01"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "sdamel", "content": "愛克痰", "time": "220.135.41.12 11/23 20:58"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "lilaqu", "content": "去藥局買成藥吃 很快就好", "time": "73.150.111.100 11/24 06:52"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "maye", "content": "我自己會吃點京都念慈庵琵琶膏潤喉", "time": "61.71.113.24 11/24 12:08"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "maye", "content": "，剩下看醫生乖乖吃藥。", "time": "61.71.113.24 11/24 12:08"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "McNick", "content": "我覺得很難快，就是要讓他慢慢好", "time": "49.216.17.66 11/24 14:08"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "sasado", "content": "喉嚨不適就會想咳了", "time": "114.36.104.51 11/25 15:33"}]}